              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "luna"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Perfect over recipe for Bread Pudding II submitted by Ellen Warfield! I took the advice of another review and changed it to two TBSP cornstarch to 1 cup water. Served warm. It was the perfect consistency!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jackie Hendry Williams"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Followed recipe but I did cut water down to 3/4cup water and added 1 1/2 tbsp of corn starch. Then I added the butter while it was cooking instead of after taking it off the heat. Came out so nice and thick instead of runny",
            "datePublished": "2024-07-13T20:04:00.142Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
