            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Robin Miller"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Simple and good on bread pudding. I followed the advice of others and increased corn starch to 2 T and decreased water to 1 cup. Also, I am diabetic so I used spenda instead of sugar and no one could tell the difference. (I make this substitution alot)",
            "datePublished": "2011-06-13T18:30:43.143Z"
