              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jean Gallihugh"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The sauce is really sweet and really runny but it's actually works really well since my bread pudding is really dry. If you're using the sauce as a topping I would suggest adjusting the cornstarch a little bit.",
