            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cindy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this using the instructions on the recipe and the advice of several reviewers reducing the water and adding more cornstarch. Thanks to the reviewers tips, the consistency came out perfect. But I'm sorry to say that I did not find this to taste good at all. The flavour did not seem to \"combine\" smoothly. To me, it seemed like I made vanilla flavoured water. Perhaps I did something wrong.",
